<span id="T1.5.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Persuade others to adopt actor <math id="T1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>’s current belief.</span>
</span></td></tr>
